.TH HSH 1 "May 2026" "1.0" "Simple Shell Manual"

.SH NAME
hsh \- simple UNIX command interpreter

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hsh

.SH DESCRIPTION
Simple Shell is a command line interpreter written in C.

The shell reads commands from standard input and executes them.

.SH FEATURES
- Interactive mode
- Non-interactive mode
- Execute commands with full path

.SH USAGE
Run the shell:

.B ./hsh

Example:

.B /bin/ls

